          "legendFormat": "{{status_class}}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Caddy access lines on web and web-tls. Log panels read the scrubbed lines Alloy ships from the `tpa` compose project. An empty panel with the tpa stack \"not running\" on the overview is expected.",
